  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## Changes since 0.8.0\n\n### Breaking Changes\n* Removed ``ICommand`` - Users of the library should use the ``Command`` class directly instead.\n* Renamed ``AbstractSpecializedCommand`` to ``AbstractInstallableCommand``\n* Added ``IsCurrentOperatingSystemSupported`` method to ``AbstractInstallableCommand``\n\n### Non-Breaking Changes\n\n#### Additions\n* Added ``AddCliRunner`` Dependency Injection extension to make it easier to use CliRunner with Dependency Injection,\n\n#### General Changes\n* Updated minimum Polyfill version from 7.11.0 to 7.12.0\n* Replaced ``RuntimeExtensions`` dependency on .NET Standard 2.0 and 2.1 with ``OSCompatibilityLib``\n* Optimized EnvironmentVariableBuilder for .NET 8 and .NET 9 users",
  "repository": "",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
  "title": "CliRunner",
